1. d4 d5 2. c4 c6 3. Nc3 dxc4 4. e4 b5 5. a4 b4 6. Nb1 $6 (6. Na2 Nf6 7. f3 e5
8. Bxc4 Qxd4 9. Qc2 {Lautier,J (2645)-Sokolov,I (2630) Groningen 1995, (0-1,
21)}) 6... Ba6 7. Nf3 Nf6 8. e5 Nd5 {White realises that standard plans allow
Black to consolidate so he tries to weaken the black kingside.} 9. Ng5 h6 10.
Qh5 hxg5 $1 11. Qxh8 Nf4 12. Be3 Qd5 13. f3 (13. h4) 13... Ne6 $6 (13... c5 $19
) 14. Nd2 Nxd4 15. O-O-O c3 (15... c5 $19) 16. Nc4 Bxc4 $4 ({Completely
missing White's idea. I felt like a complete idiot.} 16... c5 17. Bxd4 cxd4 18.
b3 Nd7 19. Bd3 Nc5 $19) 17. Rxd4 $18 Qxe5 $4 18. Qxf8+ $3 {Source: bulletin}
1-0

